/expression wanted: Both of us sitting at a table, with wine glasses, looking like we are having a good time as Chiaki gives Skylar a bright/soft smile with her eyes closed. (They are on a date) \n\nCharacter name: Skylar Prisma(Blue Hair Cat-girl)\nCharacter name: Chiaki Nadeshiko (blue and pink hair girl)\n\nポーズ/表情: ワイングラスを持ってテーブルに座り、二人で楽しい時間を過ごしている様子。千秋は目を閉じてスカイラーに明るく優しい笑顔を向けています。(デート中です)\n\nキャラクター名: スカイラー プリズマ(青髪の猫娘)\nキャラクター名: 千秋なでしこ(青とピンクの髪の少女)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_f06bviFHV9U3tdBzNnfyrW2O6Nt0r4B?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@100_wnkr/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2986207, "client_id": 3063117, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1c3-8aeb-4bf4-be42-2f63306694c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a64b7b102d9ed9c8cff1de5566df5371", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1c3-8aeb-4bf4-be42-2f63306694c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a64b7b102d9ed9c8cff1de5566df5371, https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1c3-8aeb-4bf4-be42-2f63306694c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78b41baf4ba3fd101bf4537f9f5368e2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1c3-8aeb-4bf4-be42-2f63306694c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbe92f0d773cdff88bb4ae9e26445aa8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1c3-8aeb-4bf4-be42-2f63306694c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c65ed26d79845ca1d16e3aebea64a1fb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e543b54f/uploads/origins/109bc1